            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was just ok, but I much prefer my Dark N Stormy with a squeeze of lime added in to balance out the other flavors. Pour the ginger beer over ice, then float the rum over top, for a lovely layered effect of a \"stormy\" sky.",
